<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Machine Condition Report {{ machine_name }}</title>
<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    /* Top/bottom margins widened vs. the original 2cm to leave room for the
       running letterhead/footer (see .letterhead / .doc-footer below) —
       WeasyPrint renders @top-center/@bottom-left content inside the page
       margin box, so the margin itself must be tall enough to fit it. Top
       margin sized for the larger logo below (40px + padding). */
    margin: 4.2cm 1.8cm 2.6cm 1.8cm;
    @top-center {
      content: element(pageHeader);
    }
    @bottom-left {
      content: element(pageFooter);
    }
    @bottom-right {
      content: "Page " counter(page) " of " counter(pages);
      font-size: 8pt;
      color: #888;
    }
  }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 10.5pt;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  h2 { font-size: 13pt; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 1.5pt solid #333; padding-bottom: 3px; }
  h3 { font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #333; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 8px 0 12px; }
  /* Prevents WeasyPrint from splitting a row's cells across a page break
     (the bug this fixes: a row landing on a page boundary rendered with
     some cells silently missing, since only part of the row fit). */
  tr { page-break-inside: avoid; break-inside: avoid; }
  thead { display: table-header-group; }
  th, td { border: 0.75pt solid #ccc; padding: 5px 8px; text-align: left; font-size: 9.5pt; }
  th { background: #f0f0f0; font-weight: 600; }
  td.num, th.num { text-align: right; }
  th.link-col, td.link-col { width: 90px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .meta-table td:first-child { font-weight: 600; width: 35%; color: #444; }
  .meta-table, .meta-table td { border: none; padding: 2px 0; }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 2px 10px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 9pt;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: white;
  }
  .badge-normal { background: #1e8e3e; }
  .badge-warning { background: #e8710a; }
  .badge-failure { background: #d33; }
  .prose { margin: 6px 0; }
  hr { border: none; border-top: 0.75pt solid #ccc; margin: 18px 0; }

  /* Letterhead: rendered once in the source but repeated on every page via
     `position: running(pageHeader)` + @top-center above — NOT part of the
     normal document flow, so it's placed near the top of <body> purely for
     source readability. */
  .letterhead { position: running(pageHeader); }
  .letterhead-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-bottom: 2pt solid #0059ab; }
  .letterhead-table td { border: none; padding: 0 0 10px 0; vertical-align: middle; }
  .letterhead-logo img { height: 40px; }
  .letterhead-logo .wordmark { font-size: 22pt; font-weight: 800; color: #0059ab; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }
  .letterhead-tagline { text-align: right; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #666; }

  /* Running footer (brand strip) — page-number counter stays a separate
     @bottom-right box since content: on a margin box can't mix an element()
     with a counter() in the same box. */
  .doc-footer { position: running(pageFooter); font-size: 8pt; color: #888; }
  .doc-footer strong { color: #0059ab; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="letterhead">
  <table class="letterhead-table">
    <tr>
      <td class="letterhead-logo">
        {% if logo_data_uri %}
        <img src="{{ logo_data_uri }}" alt="WO.M.AI">
        {% else %}
        <span class="wordmark">WO.M.AI</span>
        {% endif %}
      </td>
      <td class="letterhead-tagline">AI Predictive Maintenance &amp; Decision Support System</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="doc-footer"><strong>WO.M.AI</strong> — AI Predictive Maintenance &amp; Decision Support System</div>

<h1>MACHINE CONDITION REPORT — {{ machine_name | upper }}</h1>

<h2>Report Information</h2>
<table class="meta-table">
  <tr><td>Report Date</td><td>{{ report_datetime }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Report No.</td><td>{{ report_number }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Machine ID</td><td>{{ machine_id }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Machine Name</td><td>{{ machine_name }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Operating Status</td><td>
    <span class="badge {% if operating_status == 'Failure' %}badge-failure{% elif operating_status == 'Warning' %}badge-warning{% else %}badge-normal{% endif %}">
      {{ operating_status }}
    </span>
  </td></tr>
</table>

<hr>

<h2>1. Average Machine Condition</h2>
<p class="prose">This section provides a snapshot of the machine's condition at the time this report was generated.</p>
<table>
  <tr><th>Parameter</th><th class="num">Value</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Air Temperature</td><td class="num">{{ sensor.air_temperature_k }} K</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Process Temperature</td><td class="num">{{ sensor.process_temperature_k }} K</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Rotational Speed</td><td class="num">{{ sensor.rotational_speed_rpm }} RPM</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Machine Operating Time (Tool Wear)</td><td class="num">{{ sensor.tool_wear_min }} Minute</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Health Score</td><td class="num">{{ prediction.health_score }}/100</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Failure Probability in +{{ horizon_minutes }} Minute</td><td class="num">{% if horizon_pct is not none %}{{ horizon_pct }}%{% else %}N/A{% endif %}</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>AI Condition Summary</h3>
<p class="prose">{{ narrative.condition_summary }}</p>

<hr>

<h2>2. Failure Risk Prediction</h2>
<h3>Prediction Result</h3>
<table class="meta-table">
  <tr><td>Failure Risk</td><td>{{ failure_risk_pct }}%</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Risk Level</td><td>{{ risk_level }}</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>Top Contributing Factor</h3>
<p class="prose">{{ top_feature_label }}</p>

<h3>Feature Contribution</h3>
<table>
  <tr><th>Feature</th><th class="num">Failure Contribution</th><th>Interpretation</th></tr>
  {% for f in shap_features %}
  <tr><td>{{ f.label }}</td><td class="num">{{ f.contribution_score }}/100</td><td>{{ f.interpretation }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>

<h3>AI Diagnosis</h3>
<p class="prose">{{ narrative.ai_diagnosis }}</p>

<h3>Machine Parts Checking</h3>
{% if parts_checking %}
<table>
  <tr><th>Component / Part</th><th>Condition</th><th>Finding</th></tr>
  {% for part in parts_checking %}
  <tr><td>{{ part.name }}</td><td>{{ part.condition }}</td><td>{{ part.finding }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>
{% else %}
<p class="prose">No specific part was identified as problematic in this report.</p>
{% endif %}

<hr>

<h2>3. Handling in Accordance with Standard Operating Procedures</h2>
<p class="prose">This section contains recommended actions based on the manual, SOP, or troubleshooting guide.</p>
{% if root_cause %}
<h3>What Is the Problem</h3>
<p class="prose">{{ root_cause.what_is_the_problem | safe if root_cause.what_is_the_problem else "Not available." }}</p>
<h3>Handling Procedure</h3>
<p class="prose">{{ root_cause.handling_procedure | safe if root_cause.handling_procedure else "Not available." }}</p>
<h3>Affected Part / Component</h3>
<p class="prose">{{ root_cause.affected_part | safe if root_cause.affected_part else "Not available." }}</p>
{% else %}
<p class="prose">No root-cause analysis for this report (normal machine condition, RAG was not run).</p>
{% endif %}

<hr>

<h2>4. Estimated Machine Part Cost</h2>
<p class="prose">This section provides a cost estimate for components that may be needed.</p>
{% if part_prices %}
<table>
  <tr><th>Part Name</th><th class="num">Estimated Price Range</th><th class="link-col">Link</th></tr>
  {% for p in part_prices %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{ p.part_name }}</td>
    <td class="num">{{ p.price_text }}</td>
    <td class="link-col">{% if p.source_url %}<a href="{{ p.source_url }}">View Product</a>{% else %}-{% endif %}</td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  {% if total_cost_text %}
  <tr><td><strong>Total Estimated Cost</strong></td><td class="num"><strong>{{ total_cost_text }}</strong></td><td class="link-col"></td></tr>
  {% endif %}
</table>
{% else %}
<p class="prose">No e-commerce part price data is available for this report yet.</p>
{% endif %}

<hr>

<h2>5. Machine Condition Log</h2>
<p class="prose">This section contains the machine's condition history over the observed period.</p>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>No.</th><th>Timestamp</th><th class="num">Air Temp</th><th class="num">Process Temp</th><th class="num">Rotational Speed</th><th class="num">Tool Wear</th><th class="num">Health Score</th><th class="num">Failure Risk</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for log in condition_log %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
      <td>{{ log.timestamp }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ log.air_temperature_k }} K</td>
      <td class="num">{{ log.process_temperature_k }} K</td>
      <td class="num">{{ log.rotational_speed_rpm }} RPM</td>
      <td class="num">{{ log.tool_wear_min }} min</td>
      <td class="num">{{ log.health_score }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ log.failure_risk_pct }}%</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<hr>

<h2>6. Summary</h2>
{% for paragraph in narrative.summary.split("\n\n") %}
<p class="prose">{{ paragraph }}</p>
{% endfor %}

</body>
</html>
